{"synopsis":"Dataran Tengah jatuh ke tangan invasi dari Dunia Iblis.\n\nSeorang pendekar bela diri, Sa Bigang, akhirnya terseret ke dunia neraka itu. Setelah bertahan di ambang kematian dan melewati penderitaan yang tak terbayangkan, ia terbangun sepuluh tahun sebelum invasi itu dimulai.\n\nKini, Sa Bigang bertekad untuk menghentikan kembalinya Dunia Iblis.\n\nUntuk mewujudkannya, ia harus mengembalikan ketertiban di dunia murim dan membangun kekuatan pamungkas: Pasukan Tak Terkalahkan (Undefeatable Corps).\n\nSebagai pria yang akan menulis ulang masa lalu dan melindungi masa depan…\n\nKali ini, dia tidak akan pernah kalah.","alternative_title":"귀환마교관, Returning Demon Instructor","author":"Fish","artist":"Midnight Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"872fc473-2247-4e28-bf59-f0b957e44b50","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ef42e30b-453e-4968-ac65-908987871f7d/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga